7	/**
8	 * Assigns a newly created owner a customer code formatted as
9	 * {@code <UPPERCASE_CITY>-<NNNN>}, where {@code NNNN} is one more than the number
10	 * of owners already in that city, zero-padded to four digits (e.g. {@code LONDON-0007}).
